Z||000000||GML||08-14-2001||11:52 AM||||I recently had my fuel injection system cleaned and when I picked up the car it was idleing around 2000rpm.  I replaced the IAC sensor which brought it down to around 1500rpm, but I'm still not happy with it.  Any ideas?????||||reg||1
